# Applied by Cloudflare Workers before the static asset lookup. These carry
# over the 301s that vercel.json declared when donate and careers were folded
# into contact (docs/15-contact-consolidation.md), so no old link 404s.
# Both slash forms are listed because redirects run before the trailing-slash
# normalisation that html_handling applies to real pages.

/donate            /contact/     301
/donate/           /contact/     301
/km/donate         /km/contact/  301
/km/donate/        /km/contact/  301
/careers           /contact/     301
/careers/*         /contact/     301
/km/careers        /km/contact/  301
/km/careers/*      /km/contact/  301
